  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together grated carrots, sliced cucumber, Jamaican Jerk Seasoning, and shredded Cheddar Cheese.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together crushed Corn Flakes and Vegetable Oil.",
    "Add the Corn Flake mixture to the carrot mixture and stir until well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a mini muffin tin.",
    "Drizzle with Salad Dressing and Umami Soy Sauce.",
    "Bake for 12-15 minutes or until the tops are lightly browned.",
    "Remove from oven and sprinkle with Salt to taste.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
